"[color=#ff3300]{0}[/color], [color=#33ff00]{1}[/color] and [color=#00ff88]{2}"
"[/color]!"

msgid "CONTEXT_WINNER_REVEAL_FOUR_PLAYER"
msgstr ""
"[color=#ff3300]{0}[/color], [color=#33ff00]{1}[/color], [color=#00ff88]{2}[/"
"color] and [color=#ffff33]{3}[/color]!"

msgid "CONTEXT_LABEL_CAKES"
msgstr "Cakes"

msgid "CONTEXT_LABEL_COOKIES"
msgstr "Cookies"

msgid "CONTEXT_GNU_NAME"
msgstr "Joy"

msgid "CONTEXT_GNU_EVENT_START"
msgstr "Hey there, need some help? Let me see, what I can do for you today…"

msgid "CONTEXT_GNU_MINIGAME_SOLO_MODERATION"
msgstr ""
"It's a solo minigame! Show me your skills and I'll give you a [color=#dd44ff]"
"{reward}[/color]"

msgid "CONTEXT_GNU_MINIGAME_SOLO"
msgstr "Solo Minigame"

msgid "CONTEXT_GNU_MINIGAME_COOP_MODERATION"
msgstr "Let's play together! I'm sure this will be fun"

msgid "CONTEXT_GNU_MINIGAME_COOP"
msgstr "Coop Minigame"

msgid "CONTEXT_GNU_SOLO_VICTORY"
msgstr "Well done. Here's your reward!"

msgid "CONTEXT_GNU_SOLO_LOSS"
msgstr "That didn't work out. Maybe next time."

msgid "CONTEXT_GNU_COOP_VICTORY"
msgstr "You did it. I'll look forward to the next time."

msgid "CONTEXT_GNU_COOP_LOSS"
msgstr ""
"Although you didn't make it, you practiced your teamwork. I'm sure next time "
"will work out for you!"

msgid "CONTEXT_NOLOK_NAME"
msgstr "Glitch"

msgid "CONTEXT_NOLOK_ACTION_TYPE"
msgstr "Glitch Action"

msgid "CONTEXT_NOLOK_EVENT_START"
msgstr "It's my turn! I know exactly, what to do…"

msgid "CONTEXT_NOLOK_MINIGAME_SOLO_MODERATION"
msgstr ""
"I challenge you to a minigame! If you can defeat me, you can keep your "
"stuff. If not I'll take one of your cakes…"

msgid "CONTEXT_NOLOK_MINIGAME_SOLO"
msgstr "Solo Minigame"

msgid "CONTEXT_NOLOK_MINIGAME_COOP_MODERATION"
msgstr "Me vs. all of you? Do you even think you stand a chance against me?"

msgid "CONTEXT_NOLOK_MINIGAME_COOP"
msgstr "Coop Minigame"

msgid "CONTEXT_NOLOK_SOLO_VICTORY"
msgstr "Be grateful that I spared you!"

msgid "CONTEXT_NOLOK_SOLO_LOSS"
msgstr "Looking forward to beat you again!"

msgid "CONTEXT_NOLOK_COOP_VICTORY"
msgstr "Next time you won't win."

msgid "CONTEXT_NOLOK_COOP_LOSS"
msgstr "Haha, what an easy win."

msgid "CONTEXT_NOLOK_LOSE_COOKIES_MODERATION"
msgstr ""
"Haha, there go [color=#00aaff]{amount}[/color] of your cookies. I'm sure "
"[color=#dd44ff]{player}[/color] has a use for them"

msgid "CONTEXT_NOLOK_LOSE_COOKIES"
msgstr "Lose your cookies"

msgid "CONTEXT_NOLOK_ROLL_MODIFIER_MODERATION"
msgstr ""
"Maybe you should slow down a bit. Let's see how you do with [color=#00aaff]"
"{amount}[/color] less movement for the next [color=#dd44ff]{duration}[/"
"color] throws"

msgid "CONTEXT_NOLOK_ROLL_MODIFIER"
msgstr "Cursed die"

msgid "CONTEXT_SHOW_TUTORIAL"
msgstr ""
"It looks like this is your first time playing. Do you want me to explain the "
"rules?"

msgid "CONTEXT_TUTORIAL_DICE"
msgstr ""
"The game is played in turns. During your turn, you roll a die and move the "
"number it shows forward."

msgid "CONTEXT_TUTORIAL_COOKIES"
msgstr ""
"The currency is cookies. You earn cookies by winning minigames. With cookies "
"you can buy items when passing the shop spaces."

msgid "CONTEXT_TUTORIAL_CAKES"
msgstr ""
"To win, you need to collect the most cakes. Cookies will be used as a "
"tiebreaker. You can buy cakes at special places on the board. If you buy "
"one, the cake will move to another location."

msgid "CONTEXT_TUTORIAL_SPACES_NORMAL"
msgstr ""
"There are different types of spaces you can land on: Blue spaces give you "
"cookies, while red spaces take your cookies."

msgid "CONTEXT_TUTORIAL_SPACES_SPECIAL"
msgstr ""
"Green spaces start board specific events. Battle spaces let you challenge "
"another player to a duel minigame."

msgid "CONTEXT_TUTORIAL_MINIGAMES"
msgstr ""
"After every player had their turn, a minigame will be played. There are "
"three different flavours of minigames:"

msgid "CONTEXT_TUTORIAL_MINIGAMES_FFA"
msgstr "Free for all, where everyone competes with everyone to win."

msgid "CONTEXT_TUTORIAL_MINIGAMES_2V2"
msgstr "Two vs two, where you play in teams of two."

msgid "CONTEXT_TUTORIAL_MINIGAMES_1V3"
msgstr ""
"And one vs three, where one competes with the rest. The solo player gets a "
"bonus to even things up."

msgid "CONTEXT_TUTORIAL_MINIGAMES_SPECIAL"
msgstr ""
"Special minigames will be played when a player lands on a Joy or Glitch "
"space. Joy minigames are good, while Glitch minigames are bad for you. So "
"better stay away from the latter!"

msgid "CONTEXT_TUTORIAL_END"
msgstr "That's it, now you're ready to go! Have fun!"

msgid "CONTEXT_CAKE_PLACED"
msgstr "Here's the cake, come and get it!"

msgid "CONTEXT_CAKE_WANT_BUY"
msgstr "Do you want to buy a cake?"

msgid "CONTEXT_CAKE_BUY_AMOUNT"
msgstr "How many cakes do you want to buy?"

msgid "CONTEXT_CAKE_COLLECTED"
msgstr ""
